@local/dsh-deepseek-status README · DeepSeek Status Lamp for DeepSeek Harness：- **Capability**: UI / experience — an ambient monitoring decoration, no agent tools added.
- **One line**: install it and the Harness sidebar grows a live DeepSeek service-status lamp
  you can read at a glance and inspect by hovering.

@local/dsh-deepseek-status README · How it gets the data：`status.deepseek.com` is a Next.js app-router page: live data arrives inside the served HTML as
a React flight payload, and the origin sends no CORS headers, so a browser cannot read it
